        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3021530/extras/092b428e2281cd61e9c58f964189ec65.avif?t=1778238700\" width=1560 height=403 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3021530/extras/d98d62fe6de3de7d217a644ac47f4813.poster.avif?t=1778238700\" width=1170 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3021530/extras/d98d62fe6de3de7d217a644ac47f4813.webm?t=1778238700\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3021530/extras/d98d62fe6de3de7d217a644ac47f4813.mp4?t=1778238700\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What must a chef entrusted with starting a new restaurant in London do? That's right, prepare a menu and come up with a name for the place. Except you've almost missed the deadline. Being out of ideas, you felt super-lucky to see an email offering to solve your exact problem. You clicked on the attached link, and then… Welcome to Wonderland's one and only mobile cafe. A long journey awaits you in the unpleasant company of the smug Cat. Fingers crossed, you'll find a way back home. But firstly, you have to feed the locals. Yet they are eccentric, capricious in their tastes, and tend to interfere in your cooking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3021530/extras/2165bb187d4ee4ba92abca1b6c2a8bd0.poster.avif?t=1778238700\" width=1170 height=780 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3021530/extras/2165bb187d4ee4ba92abca1b6c2a8bd0.webm?t=1778238700\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3021530/extras/2165bb187d4ee4ba92abca1b6c2a8bd0.mp4?t=1778238700\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3021530/extras/f18b9e7fcdf5159fea85ed7caac3e04f.avif?t=1778238700\" width=1560 height=1852 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3021530/extras/1ee7d263d78e48bc882936c1418b77ed.poster.avif?t=1778238700\" width=615 height=228 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3021530/extras/1ee7d263d78e48bc882936c1418b77ed.webm?t=1778238700\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3021530/extras/092b428e2281cd61e9c58f964189ec65.avif?t=1778238700\" width=1560 height=403 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3021530/extras/d98d62fe6de3de7d217a644ac47f4813.poster.avif?t=1778238700\" width=1170 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3021530/extras/d98d62fe6de3de7d217a644ac47f4813.webm?t=1778238700\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3021530/extras/d98d62fe6de3de7d217a644ac47f4813.mp4?t=1778238700\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What must a chef entrusted with starting a new restaurant in London do? That's right, prepare a menu and come up with a name for the place. Except you've almost missed the deadline. Being out of ideas, you felt super-lucky to see an email offering to solve your exact problem. You clicked on the attached link, and then… Welcome to Wonderland's one and only mobile cafe. A long journey awaits you in the unpleasant company of the smug Cat. Fingers crossed, you'll find a way back home. But firstly, you have to feed the locals. Yet they are eccentric, capricious in their tastes, and tend to interfere in your cooking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3021530/extras/2165bb187d4ee4ba92abca1b6c2a8bd0.poster.avif?t=1778238700\" width=1170 height=780 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3021530/extras/2165bb187d4ee4ba92abca1b6c2a8bd0.webm?t=1778238700\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3021530/extras/2165bb187d4ee4ba92abca1b6c2a8bd0.mp4?t=1778238700\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3021530/extras/f18b9e7fcdf5159fea85ed7caac3e04f.avif?t=1778238700\" width=1560 height=1852 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3021530/extras/1ee7d263d78e48bc882936c1418b77ed.poster.avif?t=1778238700\" width=615 height=228 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3021530/extras/1ee7d263d78e48bc882936c1418b77ed.webm?t=1778238700\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>",
